msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/honorificPositionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "honorificPosition is functional"
msgstr "honorificPosition 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/honorificPositionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:honorificPosition is functional: a given honorific is rendered in exactly one place relative to the name — either as a prefix or as a suffix, never both — so each gmeow:Honorific fixes a single render position."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:honorificPosition 是函数性的:给定的敬称恰好在相对于姓名的一个位置上呈现——要么作为前缀,要么作为后缀,绝不同时两者——因此每个 gmeow:Honorific 固定一个单一的呈现位置。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/nameLanguageFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "nameLanguage is functional"
msgstr "nameLanguage 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/nameLanguageFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that nameLanguage is functional: at most one language value per appellation over all asserted and entailed values. This characteristic does not require language presence or identify an unknown language. Co-equal multilingual names remain separate co-equal Appellations rather than multi-tagging one name, preserving anti-colonial and symmetric naming."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 nameLanguage 具有函数性：每个称谓在所有已断言和可推导的值中至多有一个语言值。此特征不要求语言值必须存在，也不标识未知语言。地位平等的多语言名称仍是各自独立且地位平等的 Appellation，而不是对一个名称进行多重标注，从而保持命名的反殖民性与对称性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/namePartTypeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "namePartType is functional"
msgstr "namePartType 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/namePartTypeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:namePartType is functional: a single gmeow:NamePart has exactly one kind, since a component that is at once a surname and a patronymic is modelled as two distinct parts rather than one part bearing two types."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:namePartType 是函数式的:单个 gmeow:NamePart 恰好只有一种类型,因为一个同时既是姓氏又是父名的成分会被建模为两个不同的部分,而不是一个承载两种类型的部分。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/partOrderFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "partOrder is functional"
msgstr "partOrder 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/partOrderFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:partOrder is functional: a gmeow:NamePart occupies exactly one 0-based position in its appellation's surface order — a component has a single place as actually written in its culture. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:partOrder 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:NamePart 在其称谓的表层顺序中恰好占据一个从0开始的位置——一个组成部分在其文化中实际书写时只有一个位置。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/pronounObjectFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "pronounObject is functional"
msgstr "pronounObject 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/pronounObjectFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:pronounObject is functional: a gmeow:PronounSet has exactly one object (accusative) form — the single word that fills that one grammatical slot. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:pronounObject 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:PronounSet 恰好拥有一个宾格(直接宾语)形式——填入该唯一语法槽位的那一个词。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/pronounPossessiveDeterminerFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "pronounPossessiveDeterminer is functional"
msgstr "pronounPossessiveDeterminer 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/pronounPossessiveDeterminerFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:pronounPossessiveDeterminer is functional: a gmeow:PronounSet has exactly one possessive determiner form — the single word that fills that one grammatical slot. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:pronounPossessiveDeterminer 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:PronounSet 恰好拥有一个物主限定词形式——填入该唯一语法槽位的那一个词。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/pronounPossessiveFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
