msgstr "pronounPossessive 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/pronounPossessiveFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:pronounPossessive is functional: a gmeow:PronounSet has exactly one possessive pronoun form — the single word that fills that one grammatical slot. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:pronounPossessive 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:PronounSet 恰好拥有一个物主代词形式——填入该唯一语法槽位的那一个词。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/pronounReflexiveFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "pronounReflexive is functional"
msgstr "pronounReflexive 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/pronounReflexiveFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:pronounReflexive is functional: a gmeow:PronounSet has exactly one reflexive form — the single word that fills that one grammatical slot. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:pronounReflexive 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:PronounSet 恰好拥有一个反身形式——填入该唯一语法槽位的那一个词。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/pronounSubjectFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "pronounSubject is functional"
msgstr "pronounSubject 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/pronounSubjectFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:pronounSubject is functional: a gmeow:PronounSet has exactly one subject (nominative) form — the single word that fills that one grammatical slot. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:pronounSubject 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:PronounSet 恰好拥有一个主格形式——填入该唯一语法槽位的那一个词。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/usageAppellationFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "usageAppellation is functional"
msgstr "usageAppellation 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/usageAppellationFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:usageAppellation is functional: a gmeow:NameUsage relator binds exactly one appellation — the single name by which its subject is called in that reified use, so a different appellation is a different usage. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:usageAppellation 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:NameUsage 关系元恰好绑定一个称谓——即在该具象化用法中其主体被称呼的唯一名称,因此不同的称谓即构成不同的用法。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/usageNamedFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "usageNamed is functional"
msgstr "usageNamed 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/usageNamedFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:usageNamed is functional: a gmeow:NameUsage relator names exactly one entity — the single subject called by its appellation in that reified use, so a different named entity is a different usage. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:usageNamed 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:NameUsage 关系元恰好命名一个实体——即在该具象化用法中被其称谓所称呼的唯一主体,因此不同的被命名实体即构成不同的用法。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/usageRegisterFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "usageRegister is functional"
msgstr "usageRegister 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/usageRegisterFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:usageRegister is functional: a gmeow:NameUsage carries exactly one social register — the single formal, intimate, professional, or casual posture of that one reified use of a name. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:usageRegister 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:NameUsage 恰好携带一种社会语域——即该次具象化姓名用法所独有的正式、亲密、专业或随意姿态。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/usageRelationshipScopeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "usageRelationshipScope is functional"
msgstr "usageRelationshipScope 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/usageRelationshipScopeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:usageRelationshipScope is functional: a gmeow:NameUsage is scoped by exactly one standing interpersonal relationship — the single tie, such as the aunt-niece bond within which 'Aunt Genny' is used, this being the sharp one-relationship case of gmeow:usageAudience. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:usageRelationshipScope 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:NameUsage 恰好受限于一种持久的人际关系——例如「阿姨-侄女」这一唯一纽带,在其中使用「Genny 姨」,这正是 gmeow:usageAudience 中明确的单一关系情形。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/honorificPositionFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:honorificPosition names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须强制 gmeow:honorificPosition 恰好命名一个值 时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务是被推理出来的，而非在形状表面上重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/honorificPositionFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when a second value would make the record ambiguous — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "当第二个值会使该记录产生歧义时避免使用该记录——应撤回该断言而非削弱它，且绝不将其复刻为手写形状。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/honorificPositionFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:honorificPosition, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "与 logic:characteristicSort 一并阅读：(logic:characterizes gmeow:honorificPosition, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) 这一对构成完整义务，OWL 基础视图据此投影出相应特征。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/honorificPositionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:honorificPositionFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:honorificPosition ."
msgstr "gmeow:honorificPositionFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:honorificPosition ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/nameLanguageFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce at most one nameLanguage value per appellation across all asserted and entailed values. This record adds no presence requirement; it is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门须在所有已断言和可推导的值中强制每个称谓至多有一个 nameLanguage 值时使用。此记录不增加存在性要求；它是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务由推理确立，而非在形状表面另行重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/nameLanguageFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when a second value would make the record ambiguous — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "当第二个值会使该记录产生歧义时避免使用该记录——应撤回该断言而非削弱它，且绝不将其复刻为手写形状。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/nameLanguageFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:nameLanguage, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "与 logic:characteristicSort 一并阅读：(logic:characterizes gmeow:nameLanguage, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) 这一对构成完整义务，OWL 基础视图据此投影出相应特征。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/nameLanguageFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:nameLanguageFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:nameLanguage ."
msgstr "gmeow:nameLanguageFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:nameLanguage ."

